{"id":"torrey:prophets","source":"torrey","name":"Prophets","slug":"prophets","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"God spoke of old by — Ho 12:10; Heb 1:1.","refs":[["Hos",12,10,12,10],["Heb",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"The messengers of God — 2Ch 36:15; Isa 44:26.","refs":[["2Chr",36,15,36,15],["Isa",44,26,44,26]]},{"text":"The servants of God — Jer 35:15.","refs":[["Jer",35,15,35,15]]},{"text":"The watchmen of Israel — Eze 3:17.","refs":[["Ezek",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Men of God. — 1Sa 9:6.","refs":[["1Sam",9,6,9,6]]},{"text":"Prophets of God. — Ezr 5:2.","refs":[["Ezra",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"Holy prophets. — Lu 1:70; Re 18:20; 22:6.","refs":[["Luke",1,70,1,70],["Rev",18,20,18,20],["Rev",22,6,22,6]]},{"text":"Holy men of God. — 2Pe 1:21.","refs":[["2Pet",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Seers. — 1Sa 9:9.","refs":[["1Sam",9,9,9,9]]},{"text":"Were esteemed as holy men — 2Ki 4:9.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"Women sometimes endowed as — Joe 2:28.","refs":[["Joel",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"His secret things. — Am 3:7.","refs":[["Amos",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"At various time and in different ways. — Heb 1:1.","refs":[["Heb",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"By an audible voice. — Nu 12:8; 1Sa 3:4-14.","refs":[["Num",12,8,12,8],["1Sam",3,4,3,14]]},{"text":"By angels. — Da 8:15-26; Re 22:8,9.","refs":[["Dan",8,15,8,26],["Rev",22,8,22,8],["Rev",22,9,22,9]]},{"text":"By dreams and visions. — Nu 12:6; Joe 2:28.","refs":[["Num",12,6,12,6],["Joel",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"Were under the influence of the Holy Spirit while prophesying — Lu 1:67; 2Pe 1:21.","refs":[["Luke",1,67,1,67],["2Pet",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Spoke in the name of the Lord — 2Ch 33:18; Eze 3:11; Jas 5:10.","refs":[["2Chr",33,18,33,18],["Ezek",3,11,3,11],["Jas",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"Frequently spoke in parables and riddles — 2Sa 12:1-6; Isa 5:1-7; Eze 17:2-10.","refs":[["2Sam",12,1,12,6],["Isa",5,1,5,7],["Ezek",17,2,17,10]]},{"text":"Frequently in their actions, &c were made signs to the people — Isa 20:2-4; Jer 19:1,10,11; 27:2,3; 43:9; 51:63; Eze 4:1-13; 5:1-4; 7:23; 12:3-7; 21:6,7; 24:1-24; Ho 1:2-9.","refs":[["Isa",20,2,20,4],["Jer",19,1,19,1],["Jer",19,10,19,10],["Jer",19,11,19,11],["Jer",27,2,27,2],["Jer",27,3,27,3],["Jer",43,9,43,9],["Jer",51,63,51,63],["Ezek",4,1,4,13],["Ezek",5,1,5,4],["Ezek",7,23,7,23],["Ezek",12,3,12,7],["Ezek",21,6,21,6],["Ezek",21,7,21,7],["Ezek",24,1,24,24],["Hos",1,2,1,9]]},{"text":"Frequently left without divine communication on account of sins of the people — 1Sa 28:6; La 2:9; Eze 7:26.","refs":[["1Sam",28,6,28,6],["Lam",2,9,2,9],["Ezek",7,26,7,26]]},{"text":"To be bold and undaunted. — Eze 2:6; 3:8,9.","refs":[["Ezek",2,6,2,6],["Ezek",3,8,3,8],["Ezek",3,9,3,9]]},{"text":"To be vigilant and faithful. — Eze 3:17-21.","refs":[["Ezek",3,17,3,21]]},{"text":"To receive with attention all God’s communications. — Eze 3:10.","refs":[["Ezek",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Not to speak anything but what they received from God. — De 18:20.","refs":[["Deut",18,20,18,20]]},{"text":"To declare everything that the Lord commanded. — Jer 26:2.","refs":[["Jer",26,2,26,2]]},{"text":"Sometimes received divine communications and uttered predictions under great bodily and mental excitement — Jer 23:9; Eze 3:14,15; Da 7:28; 10:8; Hab 3:2,16.","refs":[["Jer",23,9,23,9],["Ezek",3,14,3,14],["Ezek",3,15,3,15],["Dan",7,28,7,28],["Dan",10,8,10,8],["Hab",3,2,3,2],["Hab",3,16,3,16]]},{"text":"Sometimes uttered their predictions in verse — De 32:44; Isa 5:1.","refs":[["Deut",32,44,32,44],["Isa",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Often accompanied by music while predicting — 1Sa 10:5; 2Ki 3:15.","refs":[["1Sam",10,5,10,5],["2Kgs",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"Often committed their predictions to writing — 2Ch 21:12; Jer 36:2.","refs":[["2Chr",21,12,21,12],["Jer",36,2,36,2]]},{"text":"Writings of, read in the synagogues every Sabbath — Lu 4:17; Ac 13:15.","refs":[["Luke",4,17,4,17],["Acts",13,15,13,15]]},{"text":"Numerous in Israel. — 1Sa 10:5; 1Ki 18:4.","refs":[["1Sam",10,5,10,5],["1Kgs",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Trained up and instructed in schools. — 2Ki 2:3,5; 1Sa 19:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,3,2,3],["2Kgs",2,5,2,5],["1Sam",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"The sacred bards of the Jews. — Ex 15:20,21; 1Sa 10:5,10; 1Ch 25:1.","refs":[["Exod",15,20,15,20],["Exod",15,21,15,21],["1Sam",10,5,10,5],["1Sam",10,10,10,10],["1Chr",25,1,25,1]]},{"text":"Specially raised up on occasions of emergency. — 1Sa 3:19-21; Isa 6:8,9; Jer 1:5.","refs":[["1Sam",3,19,3,21],["Isa",6,8,6,8],["Isa",6,9,6,9],["Jer",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Often endued with miraculous power. — Ex 4:1-4; 1Ki 17:23; 2Ki 5:3-8.","refs":[["Exod",4,1,4,4],["1Kgs",17,23,17,23],["2Kgs",5,3,5,8]]},{"text":"Frequently married men — 2Ki 4:1; Eze 24:18.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,1,4,1],["Ezek",24,18,24,18]]},{"text":"Wore a coarse dress of hair-cloth — 2Ki 1:8; Zec 13:4; Mt 3:4; Re 11:3.","refs":[["2Kgs",1,8,1,8],["Zech",13,4,13,4],["Matt",3,4,3,4],["Rev",11,3,11,3]]},{"text":"Often led a wandering and unsettled life — 1Ki 18:10-12; 19:3,8,15; 2Ki 4:10.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,10,18,12],["1Kgs",19,3,19,3],["1Kgs",19,8,19,8],["1Kgs",19,15,19,15],["2Kgs",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Simple in their manner of life — Mt 3:4.","refs":[["Matt",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"The historiographers of the Jewish nation — 1Ch 29:29; 2Ch 9:29.","refs":[["1Chr",29,29,29,29],["2Chr",9,29,9,29]]},{"text":"The interpreters of dreams — Da 1:17.","refs":[["Dan",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Were consulted in all difficulties — 1Sa 9:6; 28:15; 1Ki 14:2-4; 22:7.","refs":[["1Sam",9,6,9,6],["1Sam",28,15,28,15],["1Kgs",14,2,14,4],["1Kgs",22,7,22,7]]},{"text":"Presented with gifts by those who consulted them — 1Sa 9:7,8; 1Ki 14:3.","refs":[["1Sam",9,7,9,7],["1Sam",9,8,9,8],["1Kgs",14,3,14,3]]},{"text":"Sometimes thought it right to reject presents — 2Ki 5:15,16.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,15,5,15],["2Kgs",5,16,5,16]]},{"text":"Reprove the wicked and exhort to repentance. — 2Ki 17:13; 2Ch 24:19; Jer 25:4,5.","refs":[["2Kgs",17,13,17,13],["2Chr",24,19,24,19],["Jer",25,4,25,4],["Jer",25,5,25,5]]},{"text":"Denounce the wickedness of kings. — 1Sa 15:10,16-19; 2Sa 12:7-12; 1Ki 18:18; 21:17-22.","refs":[["1Sam",15,10,15,10],["1Sam",15,16,15,19],["2Sam",12,7,12,12],["1Kgs",18,18,18,18],["1Kgs",21,17,21,22]]},{"text":"Exhort to faithfulness and constancy in God’s service. — 2Ch 15:1,2,7.","refs":[["2Chr",15,1,15,1],["2Chr",15,2,15,2],["2Chr",15,7,15,7]]},{"text":"Predict the coming of Christ. — Lu 24:44; Joh 1:45; Ac 3:24; 10:43.","refs":[["Luke",24,44,24,44],["John",1,45,1,45],["Acts",3,24,3,24],["Acts",10,43,10,43]]},{"text":"Predict the downfall of nations. — Isa 15:1; 17:1; Jer 47:1-51:64.","refs":[["Isa",15,1,15,1],["Isa",17,1,17,1],["Jer",47,1,51,64]]},{"text":"Felt deeply on account of the calamities which they predicted — Isa 16:9-11; Jer 9:1-7.","refs":[["Isa",16,9,16,11],["Jer",9,1,9,7]]},{"text":"Frequently proclaimed at the gate of the Lord’s house. — Jer 7:2.","refs":[["Jer",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"Proclaimed in the cities and streets. — Jer 11:6.","refs":[["Jer",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Written on tables and fixed up in some public place. — Hab 2:2.","refs":[["Hab",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Written on rolls and read to the people. — Isa 8:1; Jer 36:2.","refs":[["Isa",8,1,8,1],["Jer",36,2,36,2]]},{"text":"Were all fulfilled. — 2Ki 10:10; Isa 44:26; Ac 3:18; Re 10:7.","refs":[["2Kgs",10,10,10,10],["Isa",44,26,44,26],["Acts",3,18,3,18],["Rev",10,7,10,7]]},{"text":"Assisted the Jews in their great national undertakings — Ezr 5:2.","refs":[["Ezra",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"Enoch. — Ge 5:21-24; Jude 1:14.","refs":[["Gen",5,21,5,24],["Jude",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Noah. — Ge 9:25-27.","refs":[["Gen",9,25,9,27]]},{"text":"Jacob. — Ge 49:1.","refs":[["Gen",49,1,49,1]]},{"text":"Aaron. — Ex 7:1.","refs":[["Exod",7,1,7,1]]},{"text":"Moses. — De 18:18.","refs":[["Deut",18,18,18,18]]},{"text":"Miriam. — Ex 15:20.","refs":[["Exod",15,20,15,20]]},{"text":"Deborah. — Jdj 4:4.","refs":[["Judg",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Prophet set to Israel. — Jdj 6:8.","refs":[["Judg",6,8,6,8]]},{"text":"Prophet sent to Eli. — 1Sa 2:27.","refs":[["1Sam",2,27,2,27]]},{"text":"Samuel. — 1Sa 3:20.","refs":[["1Sam",3,20,3,20]]},{"text":"David. — Ps 16:8-11; Ac 2:25,30.","refs":[["Ps",16,8,16,11],["Acts",2,25,2,25],["Acts",2,30,2,30]]},{"text":"Nathan. — 2Sa 7:2; 12:1; 1Ki 1:10.","refs":[["2Sam",7,2,7,2],["2Sam",12,1,12,1],["1Kgs",1,10,1,10]]},{"text":"Zadok. — 2Sa 15:27.","refs":[["2Sam",15,27,15,27]]},{"text":"Gad. — 2Sa 24:11; 1Ch 29:29.","refs":[["2Sam",24,11,24,11],["1Chr",29,29,29,29]]},{"text":"Ahijah. — 1Ki 11:29; 12:15; 2Ch 9:29.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,29,11,29],["1Kgs",12,15,12,15],["2Chr",9,29,9,29]]},{"text":"Prophet of Judah. — 1Ki 13:1.","refs":[["1Kgs",13,1,13,1]]},{"text":"Iddo. — 2Ch 9:29; 12:15.","refs":[["2Chr",9,29,9,29],["2Chr",12,15,12,15]]},{"text":"Shemaiah. — 1Ki 12:22; 2Ch 12:7,15.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,22,12,22],["2Chr",12,7,12,7],["2Chr",12,15,12,15]]},{"text":"Azariah the son of Oded. — 2Ch 15:2,8.","refs":[["2Chr",15,2,15,2],["2Chr",15,8,15,8]]},{"text":"Hanani. — 2Ch 16:7.","refs":[["2Chr",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"Jehu the son of Hanani. — 1Ki 16:1,7,12.","refs":[["1Kgs",16,1,16,1],["1Kgs",16,7,16,7],["1Kgs",16,12,16,12]]},{"text":"Elijah. — 1Ki 17:1.","refs":[["1Kgs",17,1,17,1]]},{"text":"Elisha. — 1Ki 19:16.","refs":[["1Kgs",19,16,19,16]]},{"text":"Micaiah the son of Imlah. — 1Ki 22:7,8.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,7,22,7],["1Kgs",22,8,22,8]]},{"text":"Jonah. — 2Ki 14:25; Jon 1:1; Mt 12:39.","refs":[["2Kgs",14,25,14,25],["Jonah",1,1,1,1],["Matt",12,39,12,39]]},{"text":"Isaiah. — 2Ki 19:2; 2Ch 26:22; Isa 1:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,2,19,2],["2Chr",26,22,26,22],["Isa",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Hosea. — Ho 1:1.","refs":[["Hos",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Amos. — Am 1:1; 7:14,15.","refs":[["Amos",1,1,1,1],["Amos",7,14,7,14],["Amos",7,15,7,15]]},{"text":"Micah. — Mic 1:1.","refs":[["Mic",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Oded. — 2Ch 28:9.","refs":[["2Chr",28,9,28,9]]},{"text":"Nahum. — Na 1:1.","refs":[["Nah",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Joel. — Joe 1:1; Ac 2:16.","refs":[["Joel",1,1,1,1],["Acts",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"Zephaniah. — Zep 1:1.","refs":[["Zeph",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Huldah. — 2Ki 22:14.","refs":[["2Kgs",22,14,22,14]]},{"text":"Jeduthun. — 2Ch 35:15.","refs":[["2Chr",35,15,35,15]]},{"text":"Jeremiah. — 2Ch 36:12,21; Jer 1:1,2.","refs":[["2Chr",36,12,36,12],["2Chr",36,21,36,21],["Jer",1,1,1,1],["Jer",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Habakkuk. — Hab 1:1.","refs":[["Hab",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Obadiah. — Ob 1:1.","refs":[["Obad",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Ezekiel. — Eze 1:3.","refs":[["Ezek",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Daniel. — Da 12:11; Mt 24:15.","refs":[["Dan",12,11,12,11],["Matt",24,15,24,15]]},{"text":"Haggai. — Ezr 5:1; 6:14; Hag 1:1.","refs":[["Ezra",5,1,5,1],["Ezra",6,14,6,14],["Hag",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Zechariah son of Iddo. — Ezr 5:1; Zec 1:1.","refs":[["Ezra",5,1,5,1],["Zech",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Malachi. — Mal 1:1.","refs":[["Mal",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Zacharias the father of John. — Lu 1:67.","refs":[["Luke",1,67,1,67]]},{"text":"Anna. — Lu 2:36.","refs":[["Luke",2,36,2,36]]},{"text":"Agabus. — Ac 11:28; 21:10.","refs":[["Acts",11,28,11,28],["Acts",21,10,21,10]]},{"text":"Daughters of Philip. — Ac 21:9.","refs":[["Acts",21,9,21,9]]},{"text":"Paul. — 1Ti 4:1.","refs":[["1Tim",4,1,4,1]]},{"text":"Peter. — 2Pe 2:1,2.","refs":[["2Pet",2,1,2,1],["2Pet",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"John. — Re 1:1.","refs":[["Rev",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"One generally attached to the king’s household — 2Sa 24:11; 2Ch 29:25; 35:15.","refs":[["2Sam",24,11,24,11],["2Chr",29,25,29,25],["2Chr",35,15,35,15]]},{"text":"Require to hear and believe. — De 18:15; 2Ch 20:20.","refs":[["Deut",18,15,18,15],["2Chr",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"Often tried to make them speak smooth things. — 1Ki 22:13; Isa 30:10; Am 2:12.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,13,22,13],["Isa",30,10,30,10],["Amos",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Persecuted them. — 2Ch 36:16; Mt 5:12.","refs":[["2Chr",36,16,36,16],["Matt",5,12,5,12]]},{"text":"Often imprisoned them. — 1Ki 22:27; Jer 32:2; 37:15,16.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,27,22,27],["Jer",32,2,32,2],["Jer",37,15,37,15],["Jer",37,16,37,16]]},{"text":"Often put them to death. — 1Ki 18:13; 19:10; Mt 23:34-37.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,13,18,13],["1Kgs",19,10,19,10],["Matt",23,34,23,37]]},{"text":"Often left without, on account of sin. — 1Sa 3:1; Ps 74:9; Am 8:11,12.","refs":[["1Sam",3,1,3,1],["Ps",74,9,74,9],["Amos",8,11,8,11],["Amos",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"Were mighty through faith — Heb 11:32-40.","refs":[["Heb",11,32,11,40]]},{"text":"Great patience of, under suffering — Jas 5:10.","refs":[["Jas",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"God avenged all injuries done to — 2Ki 9:7; 1Ch 16:21,22; Mt 23:35-38; Lu 11:50.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,7,9,7],["1Chr",16,21,16,21],["1Chr",16,22,16,22],["Matt",23,35,23,38],["Luke",11,50,11,50]]},{"text":"Christ predicted to exercise the office of — De 18:15; Ac 3:22.","refs":[["Deut",18,15,18,15],["Acts",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"Christ exercised the office of — Mt 24:1-25:46; Mr 10:32-34.","refs":[["Matt",24,1,25,46],["Mark",10,32,10,34]]}],"refCount":258}
